<!-- Earn: rent out what your devices aren't using -->
<section class="bp earn" id="earn" aria-labelledby="earn-title">
  <div class="wrap earn-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">02  Rent out what it isn't using</span>
      <h2 id="earn-title">Your devices can pay you back.</h2>
      <p class="lede">An old laptop sits idle most of the day. A disk sits half empty. Members rent that spare computing and storage to researchers, startups and other members through amader.cloud, and earn credit for it.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Jobs run in a sealed sandbox that can't see your files or your home network.</li>
        <li>Nobody can browse the web through your connection. Your device only talks to our job server.</li>
        <li>You choose the hours, and you can stop at any time.</li>
        <li>Earnings go to you, or straight to your building's service-charge fund.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn btn-bulb" href="hosts.html">How earning works</a> <a class="btn btn-line" href="contact.html?topic=host" style="color:var(--chalk);margin-left:8px">Join the earn list</a></p>
    </div>
    <EarnCalc />
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Community: what a building can do together -->
<section class="section community" id="community" aria-labelledby="community-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="community-top">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Community</span>
        <h2 id="community-title">Stronger as a building.</h2>
        <p class="bn community-bn" lang="bn">আমাদের পাড়া, আমাদের যন্ত্র</p>
        <p class="lede">Old devices are more useful pooled than alone. The flats in a building keep each other's backups safe, share screens and cameras, set up a corner for homework, and pass on what they don't need.</p>
        <p class="small">Try it: pick your flat, then break its disk.</p>
        <div class="restore-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-bulb" id="kill-disk">Break my disk</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-line" id="reset-disk">Reset</button>
        </div>
        <p class="restore-status" id="restore-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Your backup is encrypted and split into four pieces, kept by neighbours in four other flats.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="restore">
        <svg id="restore-svg" viewBox="0 0 520 670" role="img" aria-labelledby="restore-title">
          <title id="restore-title">A building cross-section. Your flat's backup is split into four encrypted pieces held by four other flats. If your disk fails, the pieces come back and your files are restored.</title>
        </svg>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <ul class="together">
      <li>
        <svg class="pict " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-screen"/></svg><h3>Clean walls, useful screens</h3>
        <p>Old monitors and TVs in the lobby, the lift and at the gate carry notices, lost and found, and paid local ads. The income goes to the building fund, and the posters come down.</p>
        <span class="mono">old monitors, TVs, a TV box</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="pict " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-pieces"/></svg><h3>Backups nobody can lose</h3>
        <p>Every flat's backup is encrypted, split and kept by neighbours. A dead disk, a theft or water in one flat loses nothing.</p>
        <span class="mono">spare disk space across the building</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="pict " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-tablet-log"/></svg><h3>A gate that knows who came</h3>
        <p>An old tablet replaces the paper visitor register. Old phones watch the gate and stairs, and only the people the committee names can see the recordings.</p>
        <span class="mono">a tablet, old phones</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="pict " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-bell"/></svg><h3>Everyone hears first</h3>
        <p>When the power goes or comes back, the tank runs low or the lane starts to flood, the building's WhatsApp group hears about it straight away.</p>
        <span class="mono">old phones on chargers</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="pict " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-books"/></svg><h3>A corner to learn</h3>
        <p>Two old laptops and an offline library in the common room, the mosque or the madrasa. Homework without mobile data.</p>
        <span class="mono">laptops, a TV box</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="pict " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-hand"/></svg><h3>Pass it on</h3>
